# Scarner — Free Official European Government API Keys (Optional)
# Keyless providers (Netherlands RDW Open Data, ISO 3779 VIN, NHTSA vPIC & Recalls)
# work out of the box with ZERO configuration.

# United Kingdom — Free Government APIs
# Register free at:
# - DVLA VES: https://developer-portal.driver-vehicle-licensing.api.gov.uk/
# - DVSA MOT History: https://documentation.history.mot.api.gov.uk/
# UK_DVLA_API_KEY=
# UK_DVSA_API_KEY=
# UK_DVSA_CLIENT_ID=
# UK_DVSA_CLIENT_SECRET=
# UK_DVSA_TOKEN_URL=
# UK_DVSA_SCOPE=

# Norway — Statens Vegvesen Technical Vehicle API (Free instant key)
# Register free at: https://www.vegvesen.no/fag/teknologi/apne-data/et-utvalg-apne-data/api-for-tekniske-kjoretoyopplysninger/
# NORWAY_VEGVESEN_API_KEY=

# Czech Republic — Ministry of Transport RSV API (Free personal key, 27 req/min)
# Register free at: https://dataovozidlech.cz/
# CZECH_RSV_API_KEY=
